# Installation Guide

## 1. Open Chrome Extensions

Open Google Chrome and go to:

chrome://extensions

## 2. Enable Developer Mode

Turn on **Developer mode** from the top-right corner.

## 3. Load the Extension

Click **Load unpacked**.

Select the project folder containing the `manifest.json` file.

## 4. Extension Ready

The extension will now appear in the Chrome Extensions page.

You can pin it to the Chrome toolbar and start using it.

## 5. Reload After Changes

If you modify the extension files:

1. Save the changes.
2. Open `chrome://extensions`.
3. Find the extension.
4. Click the **Reload ↻** button.

The updated version will now be loaded.
